Package: splinecongruence
Title: Edwards-Parry Spline Regression for Congruence Research
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Francisco", email = "francisco@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits one- and two-seam Edwards-Parry spline regression models for
